{
  "slug": "sdlc-kit-extended",
  "name": "Sdlc Kit Extended",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "11 optional skills layered on top of sdlc-kit core. Adds governance (TRDs, epics, milestones, steering), architecture & domain modeling (C4  diagrams in 3 levels, API contracts in 4 styles, DDD aggregates/events/contracts, design system tokens), and post-delivery analysis (incidents with auto-timestamps, traceability matrix, BFS impact analysis). Requires sdlc-kit core.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **13 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (13): `sdlc-api` (Use when the user asks to document an API, design a REST endpoint, create an async event contract,…), `sdlc-c4` (Use when the user asks to document or update the system architecture using the C4 model (levels 1–3),…), `sdlc-design-system` (Use when the user wants to create, list, or change the status of a design-system entry — a…), `sdlc-design-validation` (Use as Gate 3 of the frontend UX workflow — validates that UX research (Gate 1) and Design…), `sdlc-domain` (Use when the user asks to model the domain, define a bounded context, add an aggregate/domain event/context contract,…), `sdlc-epic` (Use when the user wants to create, list, or change the status of an epic — a large…), `sdlc-impact` (Use when the user wants a change-impact analysis over the vault's wikilink graph), `sdlc-incident` (Use when the user wants to record, walk, or close a **production incident** — the real-time event report…), and 5 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sdlc-kit-extended@claude-community` from `vellus-ai/sdlc-kit` (`plugins/extended`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "wrapper",
  "wrapper": "skill",
